      "BetaManagedAgentsDeletedMemory": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "description": "The confirmation that [Delete a Memory](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/beta/memory_stores/memories/delete) returns.\n\nDeleting a memory doesn't delete its versions. [List Memory Versions](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/api/beta/memory_stores/memory_versions/list) returns them while they are retained: each version is kept for at least the version retention period after it was written, unless the store itself is deleted.\n\nSee the [memory guide](https://platform.claude.com/docs/en/managed-agents/memory#audit-memory-changes) to learn more about how long versions are kept.",
        "properties": {
          "id": {
            "description": "ID of the deleted memory (a `mem_...` value).",
            "type": "string"
